# target_customers.md

## Purpose

This file defines the customer groups Revtek is intended to serve.

## Primary Customer

Revtek primarily serves vehicle owners interested in premium and performance-oriented automotive customization.

These customers may value:

* Vehicle appearance
* Individuality
* Design
* Product quality
* Fitment
* Installation
* Performance
* Project execution
* Professional service

## Customer Needs

Customers may approach Revtek because they want to:

* Modify their vehicle
* Improve its appearance
* Create a more distinctive identity
* Add selected performance-related products
* Source difficult-to-find products
* Complete a vehicle customization project
* Have products professionally installed

Specific customer motivations should be captured from actual customer data where available.

## Customer Segments

### Segment 01 — Enthusiast

Interested in:

* Cars
* Styling
* Automotive culture
* Modification
* Product details

### Segment 02 — Premium Vehicle Owner

Values:

* Vehicle quality
* Professional service
* Appropriate design
* Trust
* Convenience
* Final execution

### Segment 03 — Project Customer

Wants a broader vehicle transformation rather than a single product.

Potential needs:

* Consultation
* Product selection
* Sourcing
* Installation
* Project coordination
* Final completion

### Segment 04 — Performance-Oriented Customer

Interested in:

* Performance
* Driving experience
* Technical upgrades
* Engineering

Exact segment definition is `[TO DEFINE]`.

## Customer Data Rule

Do not infer customer demographics from assumptions.

Where available, use actual:

* Customer records
* Sales data
* CRM data
* Inquiry data
* Purchase history
* Analytics

